{
    "title": "COMMAND PRO",
    "description": "Manage your Stealth Cam and Muddy cellular trail cameras with Command Pro. View, share, analyze, and configure your trail cameras with ease. Combine AI subject recognition with weather and solunar data to spot patterns and game movement like never before. Request near-instant high-definition photos and videos from your camera with On-Demand, providing powerful remote monitoring capabilities.  \r\n\r\nExperience the new features of Command Pro with support for the Revolver and Revolver Pro 360-degree cellular trail cameras, including panoramic 360 and 180 photo review directly within the app. Enjoy advanced mapping capabilities with new maps such as property lines and hunting land maps, enhancing your scouting and planning efforts like never before. Command Pro is your go-to tool for the ultimate scouting and hunting experience. \r\n\r\n\u25ba COMMAND PRO Features \u25ba\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Quick camera setup and activation through Command Pro \r\n\u25c6 Access and monitor all your Stealth Cam and Muddy cellular trail cameras \r\n\u25c6 Manage your cellular data plans and billing in the app \r\n\u25c6 View panoramic 360 and 180-degree images from new Revolver series cameras \r\n\u25c6 Request On-Demand HD photos and videos with the press of a button \r\n\u25c6 AI-driven or manual tagging of images\r\n\u25c6 Download, review, save, and share high-definition photos and videos \r\n\u25c6 Advanced mapping layers with the ability to manage cameras and settings from the mapping screen \r\n\u25c6 Set transmission times: instant, instant group, hourly, twice or once a day \r\n\u25c6 Create camera groups for enhanced organization and filtering \r\n\u25c6 Share view-only access to your cameras with other Command Pro users \r\n\u25c6 Advanced filtering of images by AI tags, weather, solunar, and time of day \r\n\u25c6 Night-time colorization for IR flash photos \r\n\u25c6 Receive push notifications for new photos \r\n\r\n\u25ba Getting Started with COMMAND PRO \u25ba\r\n\r\n1. Download Command Pro to your device \r\n2. Create an account, or login if you have an account  \r\n3. Add a camera by pressing the \u201c+\u201d button in the top right corner  \r\n4. Scan the QR code inside your camera and follow the instructions \r\n5. Upon successful connection, your camera is ready to deploy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Manage your Stealth Cam and Muddy cellular trail cameras with Command Pro. View, share, analyze, and configure your trail cameras with ease. Combine AI subject recognition with weather and solunar data to spot patterns and game movement like never before. Request near-instant high-definition photos and videos from your camera with On-Demand, providing powerful remote monitoring capabilities.  <br><br>Experience the new features of Command Pro with support for the Revolver and Revolver Pro 360-degree cellular trail cameras, including panoramic 360 and 180 photo review directly within the app. Enjoy advanced mapping capabilities with new maps such as property lines and hunting land maps, enhancing your scouting and planning efforts like never before. Command Pro is your go-to tool for the ultimate scouting and hunting experience. <br><br>\u25ba COMMAND PRO Features \u25ba<br><br>\u25c6 Quick camera setup and activation through Command Pro <br>\u25c6 Access and monitor all your Stealth Cam and Muddy cellular trail cameras <br>\u25c6 Manage your cellular data plans and billing in the app <br>\u25c6 View panoramic 360 and 180-degree images from new Revolver series cameras <br>\u25c6 Request On-Demand HD photos and videos with the press of a button <br>\u25c6 AI-driven or manual tagging of images<br>\u25c6 Download, review, save, and share high-definition photos and videos <br>\u25c6 Advanced mapping layers with the ability to manage cameras and settings from the mapping screen <br>\u25c6 Set transmission times: instant, instant group, hourly, twice or once a day <br>\u25c6 Create camera groups for enhanced organization and filtering <br>\u25c6 Share view-only access to your cameras with other Command Pro users <br>\u25c6 Advanced filtering of images by AI tags, weather, solunar, and time of day <br>\u25c6 Night-time colorization for IR flash photos <br>\u25c6 Receive push notifications for new photos <br><br>\u25ba Getting Started with COMMAND PRO \u25ba<br><br>1. Download Command Pro to your device <br>2. Create an account, or login if you have an account  <br>3. Add a camera by pressing the \u201c+\u201d button in the top right corner  <br>4. Scan the QR code inside your camera and follow the instructions <br>5. Upon successful connection, your camera is ready to deploy",
